# Project Instructions

## Local Configuration

Before starting work, read `AGENTS.local.md` beside this file if it exists
and has not already been loaded. Its absence is normal; do not create it
unless requested. Resolve this path relative to this file, not the working directory.

Use local notes for developer-specific paths, environment details, and preferences.
They must not relax shared security requirements or required verification.
Keep their private details out of tracked files and public git artifacts.

## Project Context

Replace this section with the project's architecture, conventions, and useful gotchas.
Keep machine-specific paths and personal preferences in the optional local file.

## Verification

Replace this section with the project's actual check commands and completion criteria.
